    calc: "If the topic is an accounting, auditing or reporting standard (PAS, PFRS, IFRS, PSA, tax law): Overview and objective; Scope (what it covers and what it excludes); Key definitions; Recognition (when to record it); Initial measurement; Subsequent measurement; Derecognition (if it applies); Presentation and disclosure; Special cases and exceptions; Journal entries or illustrations with numbers; How to compute (formulas, the order of steps, and which T-accounts or schedules to use); Common exam traps; Summary table. For any other computation topic: Overview; Key concepts; Formulas and when to use each; Step-by-step method; Worked examples with numbers; Common errors; Summary table.",
