    arts: "Overview; Key terms; Artists, movements or works; Elements and principles; Techniques; How to analyze or critique a work; Common exam traps; Summary table.",
    research: "Overview; Key terms; Designs or methods and when to use each; Steps of the procedure; Statistical tests and their assumptions (if relevant); Ethics; What goes in each part of the paper; Common errors; Summary table.",
    skills: "Overview; Key terms; Rules; Procedures in the right order; Safety points; What the examiner checks; Common errors; Summary table.",
